<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
  <title>準備中 - 解析学Ⅰ</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      background-color: #f8f9fa;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .card {
      background: #ffffff;
      max-width: 480px;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 40px 30px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .icon {
      font-size: 3.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      color: #1a202c;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    p {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: #64748b;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .btn-back {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #007bff;
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 12px 28px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
    }
    .btn-back:hover {
      background-color: #0056b3;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="icon">🚧</div>
    <h1>ただいま授業ページを準備中です</h1>
    <p>こちらの講義動画およびテキスト資料は順次公開予定です。<br>公開まで今しばらくお待ちください。</p>
    <!-- 一覧画面（index.html）に戻るボタン -->
    <a href="index.html" class="btn-back">講義一覧へ戻る</a>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
